  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are the negative real numbers that satisfy the inequality $3{x}^{2}\\le 27.$ \n\nSo, we first need to solve our inequality for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2} & \\le 27 \\\\ {x}^{2} & \\le 9 \\\\ \\sqrt{{x}^{2}} & \\le \\sqrt{9} \\\\ |x| & \\le 3 \\\\ -3\\le x & \\le 3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe negative real numbers that are solutions to the inequality above are $x\\in [-3,0).$ Therefore, the given set can be written as \n\n$$\nA=[-3,0).\n$$",
